### Synthese contractuelle — same payload returned for both mock PRMs.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/synth_contrat_auto/v1/99999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

### Synthese contractuelle — three-phase mock PRM.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/synth_contrat_auto/v1/11111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

### Synthese contractuelle — unknown PRM. Expect the ITC error payload.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/synth_contrat_auto/v1/12345678901234
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}
